/	SYSTEM NAME TDRM [THIS IS MEANINGFUL TO THE LOGICAL CONSOLE OVERLAY SUPPORT
/	SECTION OF THIS FILE].

/	FOR NOW, THE MR8E-C SOURCE CODE IS NOT INCLUDED; IT IS NEEDED DURING THE
/	ACTUAL USAGE ON NON-ROM SYSTEMS.  HOWEVER, THE SOURCE CODE IN THIS SECTION
/	CAN BE ASSEMBLED WITHOUT THE INCLUSION OF THAT SOURCE MODULE [BEING DEVELOPED
/	SEPARATELY AND IN PRE-FINAL STATE].  WHEN IT IS STABLE, IT WILL BE ADDED TO
/	THIS SOURCE FILE FOR COMPLETENESS.

